# Registering an Update-shaped fn in Draw. Note what this locks: rustc reports
# the signature mismatch itself (E0631) before IntoSystem's on_unimplemented
# text gets a chance, so what is guarded here is that the error names both
# signatures and points at IntoSystem<Draw>. The custom text still fires for
# shapes that are not functions at all.
expected function signature
DrawCtx
`IntoSystem<Draw>`
